            "top": 470.07,
            "bottom": 442.07,
            "text": "Showed that segmenting directly from 3.13%-sampled single-pixel measurements beats the strongest clean-trained reconstruct-then-segment baseline by 3.1–21.7 foreground-mIoU points under 20 dB noise."
          },
          {
            "page": 1,
            "kind": "bullet",
            "source": "projects.lift.bullets[1]",
            "top": 442.07,
            "bottom": 414.07,
            "text": "Designed a content-adaptive measurement-to-space lift trained with scheduled auxiliary reconstruction, exceeding the prior image-free baseline by 3.2–9.9 points at the same sampling rate."
          },
          {
